chapter.name=The Forgotten Temple

# Temple
character.temple-merchant.epithet=Temple merchant
dialogue.merchant-greeting.text=Back again, customer! I have essence, seeds and plenty more. Care to take a look?
dialogue.merchant.trade=Show me your wares.
dialogue.merchant.bye=Another time.
dialogue.merchant-intro.page1=A new face! Welcome to my stall, the only one this side of the portal. Essence, seeds, a little of everything, for those who can pay.
dialogue.merchant-intro.page2=But I do not trade with tourists. The temple has its trial: race to the rune altar, jump, run, hold on, all in three minutes. Pass it and you are a customer. Here, some essence on credit, so you know I am serious.
dialogue.merchant-intro.yes=I will take your trial.
quest.defeat-forgotten-temple-guardian.title=Defeat the Guardian
quest.defeat-forgotten-temple-guardian.description=The golem has stood watch over the temple for longer than anyone remembers.
quest.defeat-forgotten-temple-guardian.short=Defeat the Earthen Golem guarding the Forgotten Temple
quest.enter-forgotten-temple.title=Enter the Forgotten Temple
quest.enter-forgotten-temple.description=Whatever the guardian was protecting is still in there.
quest.enter-forgotten-temple.short=Find your way inside the Forgotten Temple
quest.flawless.title=Flawless
quest.flawless.description=Not a single stumble.
quest.flawless.short=Pass the Temple's trial without ever failing it
quest.flawless.passed.title=Pass the Temple's trial
quest.flawless.never-failed.title=Never fail it
quest.talk-to-rootling-merchant.title=Talk to the temple merchant
quest.talk-to-rootling-merchant.description=Even in a forgotten temple, someone has found a way to make a living.
quest.talk-to-rootling-merchant.short=Speak with the Kweebec merchant inside the Forgotten Temple
quest.temple-offering.title=Offer essence at the rune altar
quest.temple-offering.description=The altar remembers every gift, and who gave it.
quest.temple-offering.short=Drop 10 Essence of Life at the foot of the rune altar
quest.temple-offering.in-temple=Inside the Forgotten Temple
quest.temple-offering.near-altar=Within 6 blocks of the rune altar
quest.temple-trial.title=The Temple's trial
quest.temple-trial.description=The temple measures those who enter it. Few are found worthy.
quest.temple-trial.short=Complete the temple's trials within three minutes
quest.temple-trial.in-temple=Stay inside the Forgotten Temple: leaving fails the trial
quest.temple-trial.warmup.title=Sprint-jump at the rune altar
quest.temple-trial.warmup.description=Jump ten times while sprinting, close to the rune altar under the temple's central gate.
quest.temple-trial.warmup.sprinting=While sprinting
quest.temple-trial.warmup.near-altar=Within 12 blocks of the rune altar
quest.temple-trial.race.title=Run to the rune altar
quest.temple-trial.race.description=Reach the rune altar under the temple's central gate.
quest.temple-trial.run.title=Run through the temple for 20 seconds
quest.temple-trial.run.description=Run for 20 seconds, exploring the temple grounds.
quest.temple-trial.hold.title=Explore the temple for a minute
quest.temple-trial.hold.description=Spend at least one minute inside the temple, looking around.

# Lab
character.goblin-scientist.name=Makinomagistra
character.goblin-scientist.epithet=Lab foreman
dialogue.scientist-gateway.page1=You fixed my generator? Hmph. Lucky hands. Fine, then you can make yourself useful.
dialogue.scientist-gateway.page2=The Gateway. My masterpiece. It pierces the Veil of Void, when it is not broken. Bring void crystals and mend it, and the breach is yours.
dialogue.scientist-gateway.yes=I will mend the Gateway.
dialogue.scientist-left-none.report.text=All three run! Only the breach console remains. Hold the Veil back longer, tall one, and my lab is complete.
dialogue.scientist-left-one.report.text=One left! My workers are starting to believe, and that worries me.
dialogue.scientist.bye=Back to work.
dialogue.scientist-left-two.report.text=That is the first of the three. Two big beasts to go, and do not dawdle.
dialogue.scientist-no-power.text=No power, no work, no nothing! Who let a tall one in here? Unless you carry scrap for my generator, stand aside.
dialogue.scientist-report-boiler.text=The boiler whistles like an old goblin! Steam for the bench, at last.
dialogue.scientist-report-compressor.text=The compressor holds pressure. Nobody goes near it without my say, understood?
dialogue.scientist-report.next=What now?
dialogue.scientist-report-engine.text=The big engine runs! My workers stepped back ten paces. Good reflexes, for once.
dialogue.scientist-report-gateway.page1=The Gateway lives! Now the rest of this junk heap. My workers break more than they fix.
dialogue.scientist-report-gateway.page2=The teleporter first. Scrap, a dubious assembly, and you will never walk all that way again. Go, go, go!
dialogue.scientist-report-teleporter.text=It teleports! Nobody lost a leg, that is progress. Three big beasts left: boiler, engine, compressor. Take them in any order you like, but take them.
dialogue.scientist-scold.text=You there, not you, the other one! Stop hitting the pipe! Ah, it is you. Well, any parts for me?
quest.lab-all-repaired.title=The whole lab is repaired
quest.lab-boiler.title=Steam for the workbench
quest.lab-boiler.description=The boiler wants scrap, dubious assemblies and spider silk from the breach nests.
quest.lab-boiler.short=Repair the boiler
quest.lab-report-talk.title=Tell the lab foreman
quest.lab-compressor.title=Under pressure
quest.lab-compressor.description=The compressor runs on Voidhearts, Enkindled Sigils and a Bundled Treasure from the Deepworks.
quest.lab-compressor.short=Repair the compressor
quest.lab-report.title=Report back
quest.lab-console.title=More time in the breach
quest.lab-console.description=The Goblin Breach Console can hold the Veil back longer. Void crystals and Voidhearts will do.
quest.lab-console.short=Upgrade the Goblin Breach Console
quest.lab-engine.title=The big engine
quest.lab-engine.description=The engine needs a mountain of scrap, boom powder, a Gobliterator core and the hide of the Voidtaken Grizzly.
quest.lab-engine.short=Repair the engine
quest.lab-gateway.title=The Goblin Gateway
quest.lab-gateway.description=The Gateway that breaches the Veil of Void lies broken. Void crystals will mend it.
quest.lab-gateway.short=Repair the Goblin Gateway
quest.lab-generator.title=Power to the lab
quest.lab-generator.description=Repair the generator in the scrap castle so the lab hums again.
quest.lab-generator.short=Repair the lab generator
quest.lab-scrap.title=Scrap for the generator
quest.lab-scrap.description=The goblin generator keeps breaking down. Fight the goblins of the breaches outside and bring back their scrap.
quest.lab-scrap.short=Gather goblin scrap
quest.lab-teleporter.title=A shortcut through the walls
quest.lab-teleporter.description=The teleporter between the temple entrance and the lab needs scrap and a dubious assembly.
quest.lab-teleporter.short=Repair the lab teleporter
quest.lab-through.title=Through the Gateway
quest.lab-through.description=You promised the young Kweebec it would be you, not his parents. Enter the breach, then come back and tell him.
quest.lab-through.short=Keep your promise
quest.lab-through-enter.title=Enter the breach
quest.lab-through-tell.title=Tell the young Kweebec
quest.meet-scientist.title=Meet the lab foreman
quest.meet-scientist.description=A goblin who runs the lab repairs.
quest.meet-scientist.short=Talk to the lab foreman

# Guard
character.temple-guard.epithet=Dreaming guard
dialogue.guard-dream.text=I stand here day after day, watching that portal. What does it feel like, going through? Cold? Like falling? One day you will tell me, right?
dialogue.guard.bye=Keep watch.
dialogue.guard-intro.text=A visitor! Did you come through the portal? I have guarded it forever and never once crossed it. If you come back from the breach, tell me. Every monster, every detail.
dialogue.guard-intro.yes=I will tell you.
dialogue.guard-rune.text=They say the goblins carve runes that hold fire and lightning. Have you forged one? Show me, I want to see it in your hand.
dialogue.guard-rune.show=Show the rune.
dialogue.guard-rune.later=Not now.
dialogue.guard-rune-seen.page1=By the roots... it is warm, and it hums. So that is what lies beyond the portal.
dialogue.guard-rune-seen.page2=Now make it speak! Equip it at a Runebinder's Lattice and cast its spell. Do that, and the breach fragment I kept for the day I would be brave enough is yours.
dialogue.guard-rune-seen.thanks=I will.
dialogue.guard-tale-glutton.page1=A goblin so fat it shakes the ground when it walks? Ha! And you beat it? How did you dodge its belly?
dialogue.guard-tale-glutton.page2=I would have run, I think. Maybe. No, I would have fought! Like you.
dialogue.guard-tale-heart.page1=You shattered the keystone of the anomalies, the heart of the Void itself? What is it like, to stand so close to the end of the world?
dialogue.guard-tale-heart.page2=Some day the elders will sing about you. I will make sure of it.
dialogue.guard-tale-revenant.page1=A knight that will not stay dead, guarding a crypt beyond the portal? Tell me everything. Did its sword glow? Did it speak?
dialogue.guard-tale-revenant.page2=You struck it down for good. One day I will see such a crypt with my own eyes.
dialogue.guard-tale-voidtaken.page1=A bear eaten by the Void, eyes full of stars? My hands shake just hearing it. What did its roar sound like?
dialogue.guard-tale-voidtaken.page2=And you came back with its hide. The others will never believe me.
dialogue.guard-tale.done=That is the whole story.
quest.guard-rune-glutton.title=A rune to admire
quest.guard-rune-glutton.description=Forge the runestone of your choice at the Goblin Tinkerer's Workbench and show it to the guard, runestone in hand. Then cast a spell, any spell equipped at a Runebinder's Lattice.
quest.guard-rune-glutton.short=Show a rune to the guard, then cast a spell
quest.guard-rune-cast.title=Cast a spell
quest.guard-rune-heart.title=A rune to admire
quest.guard-rune-heart.description=Forge the runestone of your choice at the Goblin Tinkerer's Workbench and show it to the guard, runestone in hand. Then cast a spell, any spell equipped at a Runebinder's Lattice.
quest.guard-rune-heart.short=Show a rune to the guard, then cast a spell
quest.guard-rune-revenant.title=A rune to admire
quest.guard-rune-revenant.description=Forge the runestone of your choice at the Goblin Tinkerer's Workbench and show it to the guard, runestone in hand. Then cast a spell, any spell equipped at a Runebinder's Lattice.
quest.guard-rune-revenant.short=Show a rune to the guard, then cast a spell
quest.guard-rune-craft.title=Forge a rune
quest.guard-rune-voidtaken.title=A rune to admire
quest.guard-rune-voidtaken.description=Forge the runestone of your choice at the Goblin Tinkerer's Workbench and show it to the guard, runestone in hand. Then cast a spell, any spell equipped at a Runebinder's Lattice.
quest.guard-rune-voidtaken.short=Show a rune to the guard, then cast a spell
quest.guard-rune-show.title=Show it to the guard
quest.guard-tale-glutton.title=Tales of The Glutton
quest.guard-tale-glutton.description=The temple guard dreams of adventure. Tell him how you defeated the Glutton.
quest.guard-tale-glutton.short=Tell the guard your victory
quest.guard-tale-glutton-boss.title=Defeat the Glutton
quest.guard-tale-heart.title=Tales of The heart of the anomaly
quest.guard-tale-heart.description=The temple guard dreams of adventure. Tell him how you defeated the heart of the anomaly.
quest.guard-tale-heart.short=Tell the guard your victory
quest.guard-tale-heart-boss.title=Defeat the heart of the anomaly
quest.guard-tale-revenant.title=Tales of The Revenant Guardian
quest.guard-tale-revenant.description=The temple guard dreams of adventure. Tell him how you defeated the Revenant Guardian.
quest.guard-tale-revenant.short=Tell the guard your victory
quest.guard-tale-revenant-boss.title=Defeat the Revenant Guardian
quest.guard-tale-voidtaken.title=Tales of the Voidtaken Grizzly
quest.guard-tale-voidtaken.description=The temple guard dreams of adventure. Tell him how you defeated the Voidtaken Grizzly.
quest.guard-tale-voidtaken.short=Tell the guard your victory
quest.guard-tale-voidtaken-boss.title=Defeat the Voidtaken Grizzly
quest.guard-tale-tell.title=Tell the guard about it
quest.meet-guard.title=Meet the guard
quest.meet-guard.description=A Kweebec guardian of the temple.
quest.meet-guard.short=Talk to the guard

# Seedling
character.temple-seedling.epithet=Curious seedling
dialogue.seedling.bye=See you soon.
dialogue.seedling-feathers.text=I put them under my pillow, all in a row. Do birds outside really fly higher than the temple?
dialogue.seedling-gift.text=You found it? Show me, show me! Here, I kept something for you. Do not tell the elders where it came from.
dialogue.seedling-gift.give=Here it is.
dialogue.seedling-gift.later=Not yet.
dialogue.seedling-intro.page1=Hello! Hello! Are you from outside? Is it true the sky out there has no ceiling?
dialogue.seedling-intro.page2=My big sister has a feather, a real one, soft soft soft. I touched it once. Could you find me some? I have treasures too, you know. Little ones.
dialogue.seedling-intro.yes=I will look for feathers.
dialogue.seedling-rainbow.page1=Look! Every feather and every shard, all lined up like a rainbow. Nobody in the temple has a rainbow. Only me!
dialogue.seedling-rainbow.page2=This is my best treasure. I found it near the goblin machines. It hums. I think it opens a door somewhere deep. You should have it, you are the best explorer.
dialogue.seedling-rainbow.thanks=Thank you, little one.
dialogue.seedling-shards.text=The elders let the shards catch the light and the whole room turns into colours. I want every colour. Every single one!
dialogue.seedling-thanks.text=When I am big, I will go outside and see all the colours for real. You will come with me, right?
quest.meet-seedling.title=Meet the curious seedling
quest.meet-seedling.description=A newborn Kweebec.
quest.meet-seedling.short=Talk to the curious seedling
quest.seedling-feather-blue.title=The rarest blue
quest.seedling-feather-blue.description=A blue feather, just one. Bluebirds are shy and few, so it will take patience.
quest.seedling-feather-blue.short=Bring a blue feather to the seedling
quest.seedling-feathers-blue.title=A whole blue wing
quest.seedling-feathers-blue.description=One blue feather was not enough: he wants enough to make a wing. Bluebirds, or the great beasts of the far jungles.
quest.seedling-feathers-blue.short=Bring blue feathers to the seedling
quest.seedling-feathers-dark.title=Feathers of the night
quest.seedling-feathers-dark.description=Now he dreams of feathers as dark as the sky between the stars. Crows and sparrows wear them.
quest.seedling-feathers-dark.short=Bring dark feathers to the seedling
quest.seedling-feathers-light.title=Soft as a cloud
quest.seedling-feathers-light.description=The little seedling saw white feathers on his brothers and sisters and has thought of nothing else since. Bring him a few from the chickens and pigeons outside.
quest.seedling-feathers-light.short=Bring white feathers to the seedling
quest.seedling-feathers-red.title=A splash of red
quest.seedling-feathers-red.description=Red feathers, like a sunset he has never seen. Ducks and greenfinches might part with a few.
quest.seedling-feathers-red.short=Bring red feathers to the seedling
quest.seedling-rainbow.title=Every colour
quest.seedling-rainbow.description=Every feather, every shard: his collection is complete. Go and see what the seedling has been hiding for you.
quest.seedling-rainbow.short=Visit the seedling
quest.seedling-shards-blue.title=A shard of frost
quest.seedling-shards-blue.description=Blue shards grow where the world freezes over. He shivers just thinking about it.
quest.seedling-shards-blue.short=Bring blue crystal shards to the seedling
quest.seedling-shards-cyan.title=The colour of deep water
quest.seedling-shards-cyan.description=Cyan shards glow like water under the moon. He wants to hold one up to the light.
quest.seedling-shards-cyan.short=Bring cyan crystal shards to the seedling
quest.seedling-shards-green.title=What the elders hold
quest.seedling-shards-green.description=He watched the elders turn shining shards in their hands and fell in love with the light. Start with green ones.
quest.seedling-shards-green.short=Bring green crystal shards to the seedling
quest.seedling-shards-pink.title=Pink like blossoms
quest.seedling-shards-pink.description=Pink shards hide in geodes and strange crystal trees. He is sure they smell of flowers.
quest.seedling-shards-pink.short=Bring pink crystal shards to the seedling
quest.seedling-shards-purple.title=Purple from far away
quest.seedling-shards-purple.description=Purple shards only show in the caves of the farthest lands. He calls them dragon eyes.
quest.seedling-shards-purple.short=Bring purple crystal shards to the seedling
quest.seedling-shards-red.title=Fire in the hand
quest.seedling-shards-red.description=The last colour he is missing: red shards, warm as embers, from the lands of ash and lava.
quest.seedling-shards-red.short=Bring red crystal shards to the seedling
quest.seedling-shards-white.title=White as the moon
quest.seedling-shards-white.description=White shards, pale as the moon. Geodes and deep caves keep them.
quest.seedling-shards-white.short=Bring white crystal shards to the seedling
quest.seedling-shards-yellow.title=A piece of lightning
quest.seedling-shards-yellow.description=Yellow shards crackle like a storm caught in stone. They come from the scorched far lands.
quest.seedling-shards-yellow.short=Bring yellow crystal shards to the seedling
quest.seedling-shell.title=The song of the sea
quest.seedling-shell.description=Someone told him the sea sings inside its shells. He wants to hear it for himself. Look along the shallow shores.
quest.seedling-shell.short=Bring a seashell to the seedling

# Stag
dialogue.stag-content.text=His coat now glows with every colour of the temple. He lies down beside me, at peace.
dialogue.stag-idle.text=He nuzzles my bag, then looks at me as if he knew exactly what I carry.
dialogue.stag-intro.page1=Oh, he seems drawn to the few seeds left at the bottom of my pocket.
dialogue.stag-intro.page2=His eyes hold a strange light, older than the temple itself. Maybe I can find something to give him.
dialogue.stag-intro.search=Look for seeds.
dialogue.stag-moult.page1=Strange... his coat seems to shift as he eats, as if he were moulting under my eyes.
dialogue.stag-moult.page2=A piece of hide slides to the ground, still warm. He nudges it toward me with his muzzle, as if it were a gift.
dialogue.stag.leave=Leave him be.
dialogue.stag-seeds.text=He eats from my hand without a sound. Where he grazed, the moss glows faintly, and a few drops of light gather in the grass.
dialogue.stag.give=Offer the seeds.
names.stag-names.name=Enchanted Stag
quest.meet-stag.title=Meet the enchanted stag
quest.meet-stag.description=A strange stag with great antlers.
quest.meet-stag.short=Approach the enchanted stag
quest.stag-aubergine-pumpkin.title=Seeds of plenty
quest.stag-aubergine-pumpkin.description=Only a seasoned farmer grows these. Aubergine and pumpkin seeds for the stag.
quest.stag-aubergine-pumpkin.short=Bring aubergine and pumpkin seeds to the enchanted stag
quest.stag-carrot-corn.title=Carrots and corn
quest.stag-carrot-corn.description=The stag waits by the water, as if he expected something better. Carrot and corn seeds, maybe.
quest.stag-carrot-corn.short=Bring carrot and corn seeds to the enchanted stag
quest.stag-cauliflower-turnip.title=A gardener's gift
quest.stag-cauliflower-turnip.description=His coat shimmers a little more each time. Cauliflower and turnip seeds next.
quest.stag-cauliflower-turnip.short=Bring cauliflower and turnip seeds to the enchanted stag
quest.stag-eternal.title=A seed that never fades
quest.stag-eternal.description=An eternal tomato seed, one that never stops giving. Something tells you he has waited for it.
quest.stag-eternal.short=Bring an eternal tomato seed to the enchanted stag
quest.stag-eternal-roots.title=The last offering
quest.stag-eternal-roots.description=An eternal potato sprout, the rarest of all. His coat already glows with every colour.
quest.stag-eternal-roots.short=Bring an eternal potato sprout to the enchanted stag
quest.stag-lettuce.title=Something green
quest.stag-lettuce.description=He keeps following you around the temple. Perhaps lettuce seeds would please him.
quest.stag-lettuce.short=Bring lettuce seeds to the enchanted stag
quest.stag-onion-potato.title=Roots of the earth
quest.stag-onion-potato.description=Onion bulbs and potato sprouts, the hardest seeds a farm can give. He waits, patient as stone.
quest.stag-onion-potato.short=Bring onion bulbs and potato sprouts to the enchanted stag
quest.stag-rice-cotton.title=Rice and cotton
quest.stag-rice-cotton.description=Rice and cotton seeds, rare outside the best farms. His eyes follow your bag.
quest.stag-rice-cotton.short=Bring rice and cotton seeds to the enchanted stag
quest.stag-tomato-chilli.title=Red and fiery
quest.stag-tomato-chilli.description=Tomato and chilli seeds, the pride of a fine farm. He seems to know their worth.
quest.stag-tomato-chilli.short=Bring tomato and chilli seeds to the enchanted stag
quest.stag-wheat.title=A handful of grain
quest.stag-wheat.description=The enchanted stag of the temple sniffed at the seeds in your pocket. Bring him wheat seeds.
quest.stag-wheat.short=Bring wheat seeds to the enchanted stag

# Sapling
character.temple-sapling.epithet=Young Kweebec
dialogue.sapling-generator.text=It's a bit further on, the scrap castle. Well, apparently you need scrap to fix the generathingy. But they say it's dangerous: to get some, you have to fight goblins outside! And fighting is not our custom.
dialogue.sapling-generator.thanks=Thank you.
dialogue.sapling-grateful.text=My parents stayed. They grumble, but they are here. Thank you.
dialogue.sapling-relieved.text=The lab hums again, and my parents are smiling. But promise me you will be the one who goes through, not them.
dialogue.sapling-through.text=You went? Really? And you came back! Then my parents do not need to go. Here, I took it from their things. This way they will not use it.
dialogue.sapling-waiting.text=Did you find scrap? Be careful out there. The goblins throw things.
dialogue.sapling-worry.text=My parents keep talking about the goblins' laboratory. Apparently the generator keeps breaking down. I don't know what that means, but it makes them sad, because it blocks their discoveries. They say that in this laboratory you could reach a whole new world, full of adventure and treasure! But it scares me. I don't want my parents to go there.
dialogue.sapling-worry.which=Which generator?
dialogue.sapling.bye=Take care.
quest.meet-sapling.title=Meet the young Kweebec
quest.meet-sapling.description=He flees when the goblins play their pranks.
quest.meet-sapling.short=Talk to the young Kweebec
